graph TD
    UI["1. Visitor message arrives from widget"]
    ChatAPI["2. POST /chat<br>backend/app/api/chat.py"]
    Jana["3. Jana classifier + guardrails<br>if available"]
    ChatService["4. ChatService<br>store user message + build memory context"]
    Router["5. RouterService<br>choose drop, RAG, lead, escalation, or agent"]

    RAG["6A. RagService<br>tenant-scoped knowledge retrieval"]
    Lead["6B. LeadService<br>validate + deduplicate contact info"]
    Escalation["6C. EscalationService<br>create human handoff"]
    Agent["6D. AgentService<br>Anthropic planner or heuristic fallback"]

    Tools["7. Agent tool registry<br>rag_search, capture_lead, escalate"]
    Memory["8. MemoryService<br>Redis short-term memory or in-memory fallback"]
    OutputGuardrail["9. Output guardrail<br>block or rewrite if needed"]
    Response["10. Response to UI<br>conversation_id, decision, message, trace_id"]

    ChatAPI --> Jana
    UI --> ChatAPI
    Jana --> ChatService
    ChatAPI --> ChatService
    ChatService --> Memory
    ChatService --> Router

    Router -->|"FAQ or support"| RAG
    Router -->|"sales or lead"| Lead
    Router -->|"human handoff"| Escalation
    Router -->|"low confidence, degraded, hard, unknown"| Agent
    Router -->|"spam"| Response

    Agent --> Tools
    Tools --> RAG
    Tools --> Lead
    Tools --> Escalation

    RAG --> ChatService
    Lead --> ChatService
    Escalation --> ChatService
    Agent --> ChatService
    ChatService --> Memory
    ChatService --> OutputGuardrail
    OutputGuardrail --> Response
